  <p id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line034" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line034:m0000" ref="bni_9ky_npc">鄱陽王寶夤</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line034:m0006" ref="bni_9ky_npc">智亮</persName>，<persName id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line034:m0009" ref="w4m_9tw_147">明帝</persName>第六子也。建武初，封<persName id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line034:m0021" ref="bni_9ky_npc">建安郡王</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line038" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">改封<persName id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line038:m0002" ref="bni_9ky_npc">寶夤</persName>爲<persName id="c-nanqishu-050-wangzhan-royal-context:line038:m0005" ref="bni_9ky_npc">鄱陽王</persName>。中興二年，謀反誅。</p>
